  Note: 'Created by 2b_course_materials.sql. First canonical processed table: 96,663,781 rows, one row per (period_sortable, section_id, isbn13), plus one NULL-ISBN audit row per section when present. Built from comprehensive_data; retains source/variant/conflict evidence and canonical population flags. The validated source_row_count sum is 102,885,609.'
}

